在约好的喷泉前面，\n看到了令人怀念的卓婉女性身姿。%K%P
It had only been eight hours since we'd last seen each\nother, but for some reason, I found myself overcome by a\nsurge of nostalgia.%K%P
实际上分开连８个小时都不到，\n会这么感觉也是没有办法的事情。%K%P
