%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWhen you put it like that, it only makes a guy more\ncurious.\d%K%P
「不，你这么一说我更在意了」%K%P
For the record, we weren't meeting in a place like this\nbecause \dit wouldn't have felt like a date otherwise.\d%K%P
今天，和麻实约定在这个地方见面，\n决定不再唯唯诺诺言听计从地奉行\n『因为是约会所以肯定得在外边等着吧？』。　　%K%P
Eight hours ago, around 10AM...%K%P
８个小时前的上午１０点。%K%P
...with two boxes of her personal effects in hand, Asami\nboarded a taxi and left the Terrace House Hinosaka for\ngood.%K%P
带着一个稍微有点大的包，两个纸箱子的东西，\n麻实打的士离开了Terrace House阳之坂。%K%P
She rented an apartment in the same neighborhood as her\nprevious one, once again starting her life anew -- without\nme.%K%P
在以前住的地方附近租了一间公寓，\n再次回到了不会被我打扰的生活中。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dFour o'clock?! That was two hours ago!\d%K%P
「…４点！？\n这不是两个小时之前！」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI had a lot of errands to run. I spent the afternoon\nbuying household goods, and I also needed to take care of\nelectric appliances and furniture... I ended up ordering\neverything, though.\d%K%P
「因为要准备很多东西…\n你看，家具也缺很多，上午还去买了东西。\n电器还有床什么的…不过全都是送货到家的」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dBut still... Maybe you could've just killed some time at\na cafe or something instead...\d%K%P
「这样的话…\n找个咖啡厅坐一会也好啊…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dNo, I had a textbook with me, so I figured I could\nprepare for tomorrow's class. It was time well spent.\d%K%P
「不不，因为刚好带着教科书，\n所以做了一下明天上课内容的备课。\n这可是有意义的两个小时哦？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI don't think that's reason enough to just stand outside\nfor two hours.\d%K%P
「是实在没有理由解释为什么等在车站前了吧」%K%P
In short, our relationship was no longer the kind where\nleaving together was an option.%K%P
所以我们还不是『从家里一起走』的关系。%K%P
We returned to how we used to be -- having to find work-\nrelated excuses to spend time together, and exchanging\npromises to meet again as we separated, just to keep our\nrelationship going.%K%P
在两个人工作之外的闲暇时间，用各种各样的理由取得联系，\n去约会，然后在分别的时候又订好下次的时间，\n感觉现在的关系终于又走了回头路。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dNow that I look at it... I've never seen this dress\nbefore.\d%K%P
「话说回来…还是第一次看到啊，你这衣服」%K%P
