%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dHm?\d%K%P
「嗯？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dIt looks good visually, but it's made from cheap fabric.\nStill, if it gave you that impression, it was worth\npicking it up.\d%K%P
「虽然看起来是这样，其实也还是便宜的布料。\n但是，你刚才这么一说，我费心挑选的价值就体现出来了」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
