I wonder how Asami interpreted our current relationship,\nwhich felt more like an odd mix of how we used to be and\nsomething entirely new.%K%P
这种全新的，而又有点古旧的关系，\n麻实是怎么把握的呢。%K%P
Was she simply feeling relieved at having fulfilled her\nresponsibility, and was now completely free from the\ncrushing melancholy I'd been struggling with lately?%K%P
她终究只是因为尽到了自己的责任而安心感满溢，\n把这样的我囚禁在可耻而寂寥的情感之中…\n不会是这样的吧？%K%P
