麻实额头到我肩膀这距离感刚刚好。%K%P
Leaning downwards, I pressed her head against my shoulder\nas my right hand trailed across her hair.%K%P
所以，自然地抱住了麻实，让她的额头贴在我肩上，\n右手拂上麻实的头发，然后我稍稍地低下了头。%K%P
The smell of Asami's hair gradually filled my nostrils.%K%P
张大嘴巴，呼出大量水汽，再使劲儿一吸，\n这么一来，麻实头发的味道与刺骨的寒意，逐渐充满了我的胸腔。%K%P
The smell I'd been unconsciously breathing in while we\nwere together, but one I couldn't help but crave again\nonce we were outside.%K%P
这是一起在屋子里待着的时候，不论什么时候都能闻到的气味，\n但是在外面，如果不去努力索求就闻不到的气味。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dWh-What are you doing, Osamu?\nYou're acting strange today.\d%K%P
「怎、怎么了啊理？\n是不是怪怪的啊？今天」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAm I...?\d%K%P
「怪怪的么？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dYeah... I mean... We've just met.\d%K%P
「嗯，毕竟…这个…\n这才刚见面」%K%P
The scent that surrounded me this past month...\nThe scent I'd grown accustomed to over the course of two\nwhole years.\nThe scent of a woman I knew better than any other.%K%P
这一个月，一直闻着的…\n几年间，一直习惯的，\n对我而言，最熟悉的女人香。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dPhew... I finally calmed down.\nThanks, Asami.\d%K%P
「嗯…冷静下来了。\n谢谢你，麻实」%K%P
After having my fill of that scent, I slowly drew back\nfrom her.%K%P
充分感受了这份香气之后，\n慢慢放开了麻实。%K%P
Frankly, I felt somewhat reluctant to do so, but we\ncouldn't exactly stand outside like this forever.%K%P
虽然有点恋恋不舍，但也没办法了。%K%P
Besides, our time together had yet to even start.%K%P
因为，我们两人的时间，还尚未开始。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dDid something happen?\d%K%P
「发生什么了么？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dHm?\d%K%P
「嗯？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI mean... you weren't acting like yourself.\d%K%P
「总觉得，和平常的理不太一样」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI don't normally... do things like this?\d%K%P
「平常的我…不会做这样的事、么」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dPutting that aside, I don't think you've ever tried\nanything like this outside even when we were married.\d%K%P
「岂止是平常…\n就算是结婚的时候，在外面你也不会这样…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI... see.\d%K%P
「这样、啊…」%K%P
On second thought... yeah, there might have been something\nodd with me today.%K%P
要说今天确实是有点怪怪的。%K%P
Why had I been overcome by this irresistible urge to get\nmore intimate with Asami?%K%P
为什么今天会这么想接触别人…\n倒不如说，想接触麻实？%K%P
Why did I crave her scent to this extent?%K%P
为什么会这么想要闻到别人的气味…\n不，麻实的气味？%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dWell, uh, anyway, how about we get going? It's my first\ntime at the Triton Hotel. I've been looking forward to\nthis quite a bit.\d%K%P
「总之，先走吧？\n我还是第一次到特里同酒店来。\n我可是很期待今天的哦？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dO-Okay...\d%K%P
「唔、嗯…」%K%P
And just like that, Asami moved away from the subject,\nrefusing to pay too much attention to my odd behavior.%K%P
就这样，\n故意对有一些后悔和疑问的我放任不管，\n麻实赶紧转换了心情。%K%P
It was nice to have people who knew when not to pry too\ndeep; this mutual understanding between us appeared to\nhave survived our separation.%K%P
果然，像这样\n『有意识地注意到』让人很舒服。\n我们不长时间的结婚经历，到现在仍然有留下来的痕迹。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dOh, and... while I did think you were acting odd...\d%K%P
「啊，还有啊，\n虽然我觉得理确实是有点奇怪」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYeah?\d%K%P
「嗯？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI wasn't saying I didn't like it.\nSo don't make that assumption, okay?\d%K%P
「但是我一点也不讨厌，\n这个你可千万不要自己胡乱多想」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...Asami.\d%K%P
「…麻实」%K%P
And yet, I...%K%P
尽管这样，我…%K%P
...somehow ended up divorcing the very woman who gave me\nsome of the happiest years of my life.%K%P
还是和这个“轻松的”人曾经一度分别…%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
\dHey, I'm glad you managed to survive that.\d%K%P
「哎～呀，累到了」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dPhew... Ozeki...\nWhy didn't you tell me that the champagne was real?\d%K%P
「呼呜呜呜呜…我说尾关你啊…\n香槟是真正的香槟，这我可没听你说过」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
\dHey, I wasn't the one who kept asking for more.\d%K%P
「因为好喝还连着喝了四杯的是阳坂你吧」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI mean, it had just the right amount of sweetness and\ntexture. I felt like I could drink the whole bottle.\d%K%P
「甜得恰到好处，咽下去感觉也很好，\n不管是谁都会想要再喝一点的」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
\d...You must have a genetic predisposition to alcohol.\d%K%P
「…你也是能喝酒的人呢」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI guess it says something that I didn't even realize it\nwas alcohol.\d%K%P
「没意识到里面有酒精，这可是致命性的啊？」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
\dYeah, and when you asked for the third glass even after I\ntold you what it was, I kinda feel like I caught a glimpse\nof your true nature.\d%K%P
「让你喝第二杯，你却专门又喝了三杯，\n我在你身上看到了大人物的影子」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dUgh...\d%K%P
「呜呜…」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
\dWell, you can take a break now.\nI can lend you my bed if you want.\d%K%P
「嘛，稍微休息一会吧。\n要不床借给你吧」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dNo thanks.\nGod knows what could happen if I did that.\d%K%P
「我早就想到了…\n说什么我也不会睡你的床的」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
\dPfft, like what? At worst, you might get the once-\nin-a-lifetime prize of having me around.\d%K%P
「又没什么嘛。\n我只是给你提供个选择而已」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dExactly my point... Geez...\d%K%P
「别说“又没什么”好吗…呜呜呜呜」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dWhat?\d%K%P
「什么啊？」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
\dNah, I just thought you were beautiful.\d%K%P
「不，我在想你果然很漂亮啊」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
\dI mean, your height aside, I'd say you have one of the\nprettiest faces in our class. And the entire school in\ngeneral.\d%K%P
「怎么说呢，不算身高只看颜的话，\n不要说在班上，在整个年级里都是遥遥领先吧」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dYou sure it's not just your peculiar aesthetic sense at\nwork here?\d%K%P
「那是因为尾关的审美很独特吧？」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
\dIf that's the case, then all the better. I can go after\nsomeone I consider to be number one with little to no\ncompetition.\d%K%P
「是这样的话那就太幸运了。\n我就是校内毫无敌手的ＮＯ．１追求者」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dNot like you'd care if you had any rivals.\d%K%P
「明明你根本就不在意有没有敌手的」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
\dI'm not that unreasonable. If you told me with tears in\nyour eyes that you loved someone else, I'd give up on the\nspot. I hold that much respect for others.\d%K%P
「我也不是要强迫你到这个地步啦。\n如果阳坂哭着说『我有喜欢的人了，不能与你交往』的话，\n我会无奈地宣布退出，这种肚量我是有的」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI'm not even sure if that's too little or too much,\nhonestly.\d%K%P
「到底是大还是小呢，真是微妙的肚量…」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
\dSo yeah...\nDo you have someone you love? Besides me, I mean.\d%K%P
「就是这么回事了…\n阳坂你现在有喜欢的人么？\n啊，除我以外」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dWhat kind of question is that?\d%K%P
「什么叫“就是这么回事了”啊…」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
\dWell, do you?\d%K%P
「有么？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dSo you did have an ulterior motive. You liar.\d%K%P
「果然你还是别有用心啊…骗子」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
\dI don't recall saying I didn't.\d%K%P
「不，我可不记得我有说过毫无图谋的话」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dNow that you mention it... I guess you didn't.\d%K%P
「你的确是说了…“就是这么回事了”啊」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
\dSo... do you?\d%K%P
「有么？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
\dOkay, let me rephrase this.\nHinosaka... How do you feel about Ms. Kouno's--\d%K%P
「那，我换个问法？\n阳坂，你怎么看香野老师的…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI don't.\d%K%P
「没有哦」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
\d...Are you sure?\d%K%P
「…真的？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dWell, you could say I have someone I love, in the same\nsense you love your parents.\d%K%P
「像尾关你喜欢自己爸爸妈妈那样的，\n这种喜欢类型的人是有的」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
\dYeah...\d%K%P
「额…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dBut the kind of love you're talking about...\nI think it's too early for me.\d%K%P
「但是，像你所指的那种喜欢的人，\n对我来说还太早了」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
\dGraduation's right around the corner, though.\d%K%P
「我们，马上就要毕业了不是么？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dIt took all I had just to survive this year. I haven't\nhad the time for the kind of trivial feelings you're\ntalking about.\d%K%P
「我今年一年都在努力好好读书。\n哪有时间去考虑那么多浮躁的事情」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
\dIs that so...\d%K%P
「是么…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dIt is.\d%K%P
「就是这样」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
\dWell, what about now?\d%K%P
「那，现在呢？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dNow... I have to concentrate on my exams.\d%K%P
「现在…还有考试啊」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
\dYou still can't think of me that way?\d%K%P
「我的事情，也还没有考虑么？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dL-Look... why do you have to bring this up now?\d%K%P
「你、你啊…\n为什么现在突然说这样的事？」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
\dI'm pretty sure I kept talking about it all the time.\nYou just never listened.\d%K%P
「我一直在说着这些事。\n至今为止，一直都是阳坂不正面回应的」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
\dIt took a long time... for you to finally give me the\ntime of day. And now we're only a hundred days away from\ngraduation.\d%K%P
「终于…\n终于能好好正面听我说这些话了…\n可是还有１００天我们就毕业了」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dA-Are you saying all that just because you find my face\npretty?\d%K%P
「你、你说这些话，\n是因为我的颜符合你的胃口么？」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
\dI can't deny that, but it's only about thirty percent of\nthe reason.\d%K%P
「那个我不否定，\n但那并不是全部，\n大概，占到３０％左右」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
\dI dunno how many times it's been, but let me say it\nagain...\d%K%P
「不知道是多少遍了，\n我再说一遍」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dAh, you don't need to...\d%K%P
「啊，那个，这就免了…」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
\dI love you, Hinosaka. I want to keep seeing you after we\ngraduate. Basically, I want you to be my girlfriend.\d%K%P
「我喜欢阳坂。\n毕业之后还想见到你。\n…直说吧，请和我交往」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dWhy do you have to be so straightforward...?\d%K%P
「你怎么说得一点都不含蓄啊…」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
\dBecause I'm serious.\d%K%P
「因为我是真心的」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dThen... are you saying that those who can't say it\nstraight aren't serious enough?\d%K%P
「那…\n不说清楚的人，就不是真心的么？」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
\dThat's how it'd look to me.\n...I don't know much about their circumstances, though.\d%K%P
「我是这么想的。\n…别人怎么想我就不知道了」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
\dYou don't like me?\d%K%P
「讨厌我么？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dIf I didn't... I wouldn't have come.\d%K%P
「如果是的话就不会像今天这样来你家了」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
\dThen... what do you think? About us going out, I mean.\d%K%P
「那…我们交往吧？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d.........OK.\d%K%P
「………嗯」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWell then, cheers.\d%K%P
「来，干杯」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dMerry Christmas.\d%K%P
「圣诞快乐」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...We've been saying this since yesterday.\d%K%P
「…呵，这从昨天开始是第几次了？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYeah...\d%K%P
「确实…」%K%P
We exchanged the same greeting over paper cups and cans\ncountless times during yesterday's party.%K%P
昨天的圣诞派对兼麻实送别会兼忘年会上，\n也用纸杯和易拉罐好几次碰杯。%K%P
Although, with those people, I imagine that there would be\na party every day until the end of the year.%K%P
嘛，忘年会是一直到年底每天都有。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dPhew... It was fun, but also really exhausting.\nEspecially since I had to move earlier today.\d%K%P
「哈哈…只不过，\n虽然很有意思但是很累啊。\n今天还要搬家」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWell, it was pretty... high-spirited, I can attest to\nthat.\d%K%P
「嘛，情绪很高的表演嘛」%K%P
I would have appreciated it if they spared me that\nChristmas Samba, though. How long were they planning to\ndrag that joke on, anyway?%K%P
虽然如此，果然还是不想在圣诞节看到桑巴舞…\n不如说，到底要跳到什么时候啊，那些。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dHahh... This is good.\nI wonder if I can get another glass.\d%K%P
「啊…好好喝这个。\n我再来一杯可以么？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIt should be. Up until now, I only knew about this brand\nthrough a song.\d%K%P
「好喝是当然的咯…\n只要一边听歌一边喝香槟」　　%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dIt's okay, I'll pay for it. I mean, I saved some money\nthanks to that bargain sale. ...I already used up all of\nmy monthly salary before I even got it, though.\d%K%P
「没关系的，这里我来付钱。\n你看之前买东西的时候促销，有省下一些钱。\n…虽然这个月的工资，发下来之前就没有了」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI can't allow that.\nI have pride too, you know.\d%K%P
「你别这样。\n我也是有自尊心的…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dYou want a taste, Osamu?\nHere, open your mouth.\d%K%P
「理也喝一口？\n来，张～嘴」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI don't think this is the place for things like that...\d%K%P
「这里不是做这种事情的店铺吧…」%K%P
We decided to have a little drink after the show.\nThe one who came up with the idea... was neither of us,\nreally.%K%P
表演之后，又在摩天观景台上稍微喝了一些，\n提出这个的是…实际上谁也没说。%K%P
It was just that... while we were waiting to take the\nelevator down, another one going up happened to stop on\nour floor instead.%K%P
只是在等待下楼电梯的时候，\n上行的电梯先来了。%K%P
And when that happened, my right arm pretty much\nunconsciously landed on Asami's shoulder, urging her to go\ninside.%K%P
然后，我的手不由自主地搂住麻实的肩膀，\n两个人一起走向了那个将要上到最顶层的电梯。%K%P
Asami allowed me to guide her without so much as glancing\nmy way.%K%P
麻实并没有回头看我一眼，\n好像理所当然一样，跟我一起走进了电梯。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dBy the way, how's your leg?\nI hope it hasn't started to hurt again.\d%K%P
「说起来，脚怎么样了？\n是不是有点忘记疼痛了吧？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dNo, I'm fine. I've done my rehabilitation and\neverything.\d%K%P
「不会了，已经没事了。\n康复治疗也在好好地做」%K%P
It was pretty bad when I got out of the cast.%K%P
在将要取下石膏那时候的一次艰苦行程，\n那才是真正无法形容的。%K%P
But thanks to the strenuous exercise my doctor prescribed,\nmy right leg eventually returned to form, more or less...\nAlthough I still kept relying more on my left leg and\narms.%K%P
嘛，从其中受益颇多，包括锻炼到了右脚之外的别的地方，\n比如经常依靠着的左腿和两臂。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dYou're going back to work tomorrow, right? Please promise\nme you won't push yourself too hard. I know you have this\nbad habit of forgetting your limits, so...\d%K%P
「明天开始就又要上班了吧？\n受得了么？刚开始可不要太勉强。\n肯定一上班你又不知道自己的身体状况了」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThat depends on my superior.\nI mean, I'm her only direct subordinate.\d%K%P
「那就是上司的事情了。\n毕竟直属的部下就只有我一个人」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dThen I'll ask Ms. Himeo to go easy on you for a while.\d%K%P
「那我就跟姬绪好好说一下。\n年内不要难为理」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dDon't do that.\nThey already think you're being overprotective.\d%K%P
「还是算了吧。\n肯定又只会被当成『过分保护』…」%K%P
They had gotten into the habit of drinking at Ms. Kaya's\nroom over the last few days, and I kept hearing Himeo\nscream something along those lines pretty much all the\ntime.%K%P
最近，三个人经常在{夏夜的房间:５号房}里喝酒，\n听到好几次姬绪小姐的怒吼声了…%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dWhat's wrong with that? I mean, it's the company's\nresponsibility to care for the well-being of their\nemployees. I wonder what it says about your superiors if\nthey can't even handle that.\d%K%P
「不要过分保护么？\n本来，关心员工的身心健康，这就是企业的责任，\n上司连这个都注意不到，这是几个意思？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dUm, I'm pretty sure that's not what her issue was...\d%K%P
「你跟她说的话，她理解的不会是这个正确的意义…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dOkay, I'm really worried now. Maybe you should have kept\nyourself focused on rehabilitation until the end of the\nyear...\d%K%P
「啊，果然还是好担心…\n果然还是年内一直专心做康复训练比较好…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIf you're so worried, you can return to my room. I mean,\nwhy did you suddenly decide to move at such a hectic time,\nanyway?\d%K%P
「这么担心的话，再到我房间里来不就好了。\n本来，搬家也不是一天两天的事…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dEh...?\d%K%P
「诶…？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dEh...? Ah!\d%K%P
