\d...I'm sorry.\d%K%P
「…抱歉」%K%P
I said that pretty much unconsciously.%K%P
几乎无意识地说了出来…%K%P
I wasn't even sure if those were my true feelings or just\nthe byproduct of this whole surreal situation, but it\nnonetheless brought about an awkward silence.%K%P
甚至不知道这是真心话，是甜言蜜语、还是在逃避，\n只是，这让两个人都困扰的发言，\n使得沉默瞬间笼罩在两个人的小世界中。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dNo... um, you have nothing to apologize for.\d%K%P
「不…没什么，没有必要道歉」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAh...\d%K%P
「啊…」%K%P
Was she simply unable to bear the silence any longer, or\nwas there some other reason why she...%K%P
是受不了这个沉默呢，\n还是因为别的什么理由呢。%K%P
...placed her left hand on my right, and gradually twined\nher fingers around mine?%K%P
麻实的左手和我的右手重叠在了一起，\n慢慢地，慢慢地，缠绕起十指。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dYes. It's just as you've said.\d%K%P
「嗯…就照你说的」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWh... What do you mean?\d%K%P
「什…什么？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dIt makes me relax when we do this.\d%K%P
「平静下来了…这样十指紧扣」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAsami...\d%K%P
「麻实…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dYour fingers are just as long and slender as I remembered\nthem.\d%K%P
「还是跟以前一样的细长呢…你的手指」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dBack when I was small, the other kids would always make\nfun of me for that.\d%K%P
「从小就因为手指的事情被别人嘲笑」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dLook at how different our hands are...\d%K%P
「你看，差这么多…」%K%P
Asami's palm pressed against the dorsal side of my hand,\nher fingers barely reaching the area where my nails began.%K%P
手心严密地合在一起，\n麻实的指尖还不到我的指甲根部。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAh...\d%K%P
「啊…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dHm?\d%K%P
「嗯？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dNo, it's nothing.\d%K%P
「不…没什么」%K%P
Her warmth made me relax.\nI felt like my mind could just shut down at any moment.%K%P
麻实手掌的温热，让我安心下来。\n是不是也因为这个，搞得我心里有些荡漾？%K%P
\dToko's fingers wouldn't even reach to my upper joint.\d%K%P
『要是都子的话大概就只能够到第一个指节』%K%P
I nearly blurted out something completely irrelevant.%K%P
这种完全无关的话语差点从我嘴里冲出来。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...\d%K%P
「啊…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dWhat's wrong? Do you have a headache?\d%K%P
