「不，不是，不…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dHm?\d%K%P
「？」%K%P
Remembering Toko made me recall a certain event as well...%K%P
因为想到了都子，\n刚才完全忘掉的『那个』的存在，\n从头脑里闪现了出来。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dU-Um...\d%K%P
「那、那个…」%K%P
I suddenly felt blood rushing to my face as my muscles\ntensed up.%K%P
那个瞬间，刚才还平静着的全身，\n突然开始急速的血液循环。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dA-Asami... um... you know...\nI'd like you not to believe what I'm about to do now.\d%K%P
「麻、麻实…额…那个，\n我接下来要做的事情，希望你不要当真」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dWhat are you talking about, Osamu?\nWhat has gotten into you?\d%K%P
「说什么呢理？\n突然怎么了？」%K%P
Our hands were still connected -- she could tell that my\nright palm had suddenly begun to sweat profusely.%K%P
手心突然出了很多汗，\n麻实应该马上就从紧贴着的左手发现了吧。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI'm not making fun of you, but... um, if you don't need\nit or if it makes you feel weird... you can throw it\naway...\d%K%P
