%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dCalm down, Osamu. Look at me.\d%K%P
「冷静点理。\n来，朝这边」%K%P
Asami noticed my abnormal behavior right away. She acted\nflustered for a few seconds, but quickly regained her\ncomposure and pressed a handkerchief against my forehead.%K%P
麻实察觉到了我的异常，\n不愧是麻实，在些许的惊讶之后，马上镇定了下来，\n拿出手绢帮我擦脸。%K%P
I was unable to even utter a word of thanks, and instead\nlet my hand fumble nervously in my pocket.%K%P
但是我面对着麻实这么利落的行动，\n也没有说出一句感激的话，\n只是左手在口袋里不停地摸索。%K%P
But I couldn't keep this up for the whole day. It was time\nI unveiled the reason behind this embarrassing situation.%K%P
…不能一直这样犹豫下去了。\n差不多也是时候弥补这个愚蠢的疏忽了。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAsami... Here.\d%K%P
「麻实…给你」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dEh?\d%K%P
「诶？」%K%P
