In any case, Asami appeared enthralled by that toy ring.%K%P
总之，\n收到玩具戒指之后的麻实，\n浮现出和平常不同的表情。%K%P
To the point where she seemed to like it more than the\ndinner that cost me thirty thousand yen.%K%P
看样子，跟刚才花三万日元享受晚宴的时候相比，\n现在麻实要更开心一些。%K%P
Then again, people receiving a present probably didn't\nfuss about the price as much as the person who actually\nhad to buy it.%K%P
