The first one was our engagement ring. I spent three\nmonths' worth of my salary on it because I figured all\ngirls liked diamonds.%K%P
第一次是既没有考虑设计，也没有考虑材质，\n只是觉得『果然女性就该戴钻石』，\n花了三个月工资买的订婚戒指。%K%P
The second was the platinum ring we chose together as we\nwere calculating the expenses for the ceremony.%K%P
第二次是两个人在店里来回挑选，\n综合考虑了结婚仪式的各种费用之后，\n用心选出的白金结婚戒指。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dThis is the first one... and this is the second one...\nCome, take a look. I'm sure you'll recognize them.\d%K%P
