%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAh...\d%K%P
「啊…」%K%P
I wondered what she was doing there, facing me with her\nback while giggling to herself.%K%P
我就说刚才一直背对着我，\n一边小声地笑，一边在做啥呢…%K%P
She produced two rings seemingly out of thin air, one on\neach of her palms. It looked almost like a magic trick.%K%P
宛如表演成功的魔术师一样，\n从什么都没有的手里变出来的，\n两枚戒指躺在手心里。%K%P
The diamond ring on the right palm.\nThe platinum one on the left.%K%P
右手里的是镶嵌着钻石的订婚戒指。\n左手里的则是白金的结婚戒指。%K%P
Joining those two was a toy ring that now rested on the\nring finger of her right hand.%K%P
然后…戴在右手无名指上的，\n就是今天得到的，玩具戒指。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dSo they survived...\d%K%P
「这个保存下来了啊…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
