I'd bought five rings in my entire life.%K%P
我这小半辈子总共买过五枚戒指。%K%P
One of those was at a pawnshop right now. Or perhaps it\nhad already been passed on to someone else.%K%P
一枚现在正躺在当铺里，\n也有可能已经转让到某个人的手里了。%K%P
The other one was hidden in Toko's charm, helping give her\nconfidence for those upcoming exams.%K%P
一枚放在送给都子顺利合格的护身符口袋里，\n没有被任何人看见。%K%P
And the remaining three -- as in, the majority -- were\ncurrently in the hands of the woman standing before me.%K%P
剩下的三枚…\n过半数量的戒指，都在面前这位女性的手里捧着。%K%P
